      "description": "A resident product team in Claude Code: a PM splits your PRD into features and acceptance criteria, QA writes a test case for each, and gaps and product questions come back to you. The board is held to the PRD as it stands, checked every few seconds. Keeps its memory in the repo; you can run it with /crew or by asking Claude. Made here. Work in progress: PM, QA, tech lead and full-stack today.",
